#: apps/core/models.py:111 apps/core/models.py:392 apps/core/models.py:393
msgid "two-step sign-in"
msgstr "mewngofnodi dau gam"

#: apps/core/models.py:112
msgid ""
"Two-step sign-in (multi-factor authentication) asks for a code from an "
"authenticator app after the password. People it is required for must set it "
"up the next time they sign in. It is never required on a public test site."
msgstr ""
"Mae mewngofnodi dau gam (dilysu aml-ffactor) yn gofyn am god o ap dilysu ar "
"ôl y cyfrinair. Rhaid i'r bobl y mae'n ofynnol iddynt ei osod y tro nesaf y "
"byddant yn mewngofnodi. Nid yw byth yn ofynnol ar safle prawf cyhoeddus."

#: apps/core/models.py:117
msgid "sign in with the council's own accounts"
msgstr "mewngofnodi gyda chyfrifon y cyngor ei hun"

#: apps/core/models.py:118
msgid ""
"Single sign-on with Microsoft 365 (Entra ID) or another OpenID Connect "
"service. The installer must first put the service's details in the server "
"settings file; until then this does nothing. People are matched to their "
"PHAEMA account by email address."
msgstr ""
"Mewngofnodi sengl gyda Microsoft 365 (Entra ID) neu wasanaeth OpenID Connect"
" arall. Rhaid i'r gosodwr roi manylion y gwasanaeth yn ffeil gosodiadau'r "
"gweinydd yn gyntaf; tan hynny nid yw hyn yn gwneud dim. Caiff pobl eu paru "
"â'u cyfrif PHAEMA yn ôl cyfeiriad e-bost."

#: apps/core/models.py:123
msgid ""
"Only people without a council account (such as outside consultants), and "
"administrators as a fallback"
msgstr ""
"Dim ond pobl heb gyfrif cyngor (megis ymgynghorwyr allanol), a gweinyddwyr "
"wrth gefn"

#: apps/core/models.py:125
msgid "Anyone, as well as their council account"
msgstr "Unrhyw un, yn ogystal â'u cyfrif cyngor"

#: apps/core/models.py:128
msgid "who can still sign in with a PHAEMA password"
msgstr "pwy sy'n dal i allu mewngofnodi â chyfrinair PHAEMA"

#: apps/core/models.py:130
msgid ""
"Applies once single sign-on is on. A person counts as having a council "
"account from the first time they sign in with it."
msgstr ""
"Yn berthnasol unwaith y bydd mewngofnodi sengl ymlaen. Ystyrir bod gan "
"berson gyfrif cyngor o'r tro cyntaf y mae'n mewngofnodi ag ef."

