msgstr "IPMS: Pob Adeilad (IPMS 1, 2 a 3)"

#: apps/core/models.py:137
msgid "floor areas: show first"
msgstr "arwynebeddau llawr: dangos yn gyntaf"

#: apps/core/models.py:138
msgid ""
"Which set of floor areas PHAEMA uses first on property pages, reports, space"
" costs and the data standard export. Where a property has only the other "
"set, that is used, always labelled with its basis."
msgstr ""
"Pa set o arwynebeddau llawr y mae PHAEMA yn ei defnyddio gyntaf ar "
"dudalennau eiddo, adroddiadau, costau gofod a'r allforiad safon data. Lle "
"mai dim ond y set arall sydd gan eiddo, defnyddir honno, bob amser wedi'i "
"labelu â'i sail."

#: apps/core/models.py:142
msgid "recognise text in scanned PDFs"
msgstr "adnabod testun mewn PDFs wedi'u sganio"

#: apps/core/models.py:143
msgid ""
"When a scanned PDF is added, PHAEMA reads the text in its pages in the "
"background, on this server, so Find in the document viewer works on it. The "
"original scan is kept as it was. Needs Tesseract on the server (it is in the"
" standard installation)."
msgstr ""
"Pan ychwanegir PDF wedi'i sganio, mae PHAEMA yn darllen y testun yn ei "
"dudalennau yn y cefndir, ar y gweinydd hwn, fel bod Canfod yn y gwyliwr "
"dogfennau yn gweithio arno. Cedwir y sgan gwreiddiol fel yr oedd. Mae angen "
"Tesseract ar y gweinydd (mae yn y gosodiad safonol)."

#: apps/core/models.py:147
msgid "offer Welsh (Cymraeg)"
msgstr "cynnig Cymraeg"

#: apps/core/models.py:148
msgid ""
"Shows an English | Cymraeg choice at the top of every page, so each person "
"can use PHAEMA in Welsh. The Welsh text is a draft awaiting review by a "
"qualified translator: check it with your council's translation service "
"before relying on it."
msgstr ""
"Yn dangos dewis English | Cymraeg ar frig pob tudalen, fel y gall pob person"
" ddefnyddio PHAEMA yn Gymraeg. Drafft yw'r testun Cymraeg sy'n aros am "
"adolygiad gan gyfieithydd cymwys: gwiriwch ef gyda gwasanaeth cyfieithu eich"
" cyngor cyn dibynnu arno."

#: apps/core/models.py:152
msgid "asset strategies are reviewed every (years)"
msgstr "adolygir strategaethau asedau bob (blynyddoedd)"

#: apps/core/models.py:154
msgid ""
"When an asset strategy is recorded without a review date, it is due for "
"review this many years later. The managing surveyor is prompted as it falls "
"due."
msgstr ""
"Pan gofnodir strategaeth asedau heb ddyddiad adolygu, mae'n ddyledus i'w "
"hadolygu hyn o flynyddoedd yn ddiweddarach. Caiff y syrfëwr rheoli ei "
"atgoffa pan ddaw'n ddyledus."

#: apps/core/models.py:157
msgid "outside users' access lasts (months)"
msgstr "mae mynediad defnyddwyr allanol yn para (misoedd)"

#: apps/core/models.py:159
msgid ""
"When someone is marked as an outside user (for example a consultant or a "
"tenant's agent) and no end date is given, their access ends this many months"
" later. An administrator can change the date for each person."
msgstr ""
"Pan nodir rhywun fel defnyddiwr allanol (er enghraifft ymgynghorydd neu "
"asiant tenant) ac nad oes dyddiad gorffen, daw eu mynediad i ben hyn o "
"fisoedd yn ddiweddarach. Gall gweinyddwr newid y dyddiad ar gyfer pob "
"person."

#: apps/core/models.py:163
msgid "create a PHAEMA account at first council sign-in"
msgstr "creu cyfrif PHAEMA wrth fewngofnodi i'r cyngor y tro cyntaf"

#: apps/core/models.py:164
msgid ""
"Off: only people an administrator has already added can sign in. On: anyone "
"the sign-in service lets through gets an account, with the roles and access "
"areas from the sign-in group mappings. Without a mapped group they see "
"nothing until an administrator gives them a role."
msgstr ""
"I ffwrdd: dim ond pobl y mae gweinyddwr eisoes wedi'u hychwanegu all "
"fewngofnodi. Ymlaen: mae unrhyw un y mae'r gwasanaeth mewngofnodi yn ei "
"ganiatáu yn cael cyfrif, gyda'r rolau a'r meysydd mynediad o'r mapiau "
"grwpiau mewngofnodi. Heb grŵp wedi'i fapio ni fyddant yn gweld dim nes bod "
"gweinyddwr yn rhoi rôl iddynt."

#: apps/core/models.py:170
msgid "header colour"
msgstr "lliw'r pennawd"

#: apps/core/models.py:171
msgid "Enter a colour like #1d3557."
msgstr "Rhowch liw fel #1d3557."

#: apps/core/models.py:172
