"council is the tenant). Payments come from each agreement's rent, how often "
"it is paid and its rent schedule; none are shown before a rent-free period "
"ends. Finance makes the payments: this is for checking what is due and "
"planning ahead."
msgstr ""
"Rhent y mae'r cyngor yn ei dalu am eiddo y mae'n ei ddal ar les neu drwydded"
