"The ground floor sales area is split into zones from the shop front, each "
"counted at half the one in front: Zone A in full, Zone B a half, Zone C a "
"quarter, the remainder an eighth. Other areas count at a fraction of Zone A."
" Rent divided by the ITZA gives the rent per m² Zone A."
